{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121964","id":4176347777,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc747gKB","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121964","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121964.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121964.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121964","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121964/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121964/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121964/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/d8406cd9bfe89345e363e639fb9a4dd974d91861","number":121964,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"🤖 Add continuous corner smoothing to StyleBoxFlat","user":{"login":"MarcellGu","id":170796871,"node_id":"U_kgDOCi4nRw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/170796871?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu","html_url":"https://github.com/MarcellGu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MarcellGu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> [!INFO]\r\n> *AI disclosure*: Co-authored with OpenAI Codex, which assisted with implementation, iteration, validation, and documentation. The contributor directed the design, manually reviewed the changes, and remains responsible for the contribution.\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n`StyleBoxFlat` only supports circular rounded corners. Continuous-curvature,\r\nsquircle-like corners currently require textures, shaders, or custom drawing\r\ncode.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR adds a global `corner_smoothing` property in the range `[0.0, 1.0]`.\r\n`0.0` preserves the existing rendering path, while positive values use a\r\nsuperellipse. Its parametric power is `p = 2^(-corner_smoothing)`, making\r\n`1.0` equivalent to a fourth-order squircle.\r\n\r\nThe smooth path retains `corner_detail + 1` samples per corner, positioned at\r\nequal tangent-angle intervals. Analytic tangents are used to derive normal\r\noffsets for fill, border, shadow, and antialiasing contours, including unequal\r\nper-side border widths, without fitting separate inner and outer curves.\r\n\r\nThis is an alternative to #111483, which also explored normal offsets during\r\ndevelopment. Its current implementation uses fitted exponent and coordinate\r\nadjustments for the outer contour; this PR derives related contours from one\r\nsampled superellipse. Per-corner smoothing can be added if maintainers prefer\r\nthat API.\r\n\r\nVery large inward offsets may cross the curve's evolute and produce\r\nself-intersections. No such artifacts were observed in the tested\r\nconfigurations.\r\n\r\nValidation performed:\r\n\r\n- macOS/OpenGL development build succeeds.\r\n- Formatting, XML pass.\r\n- Headless and visual tests cover circular and smoothed corners, unequal borders, antialiasing, and shadows.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1024\" height=\"640\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d161c842-7bdc-4b12-a39a-735ce115d3d5\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com